5	 * embedder on `http://127.0.0.1:8186/v1/embeddings`. Default wire shape is
6	 * OpenAI-compatible: `{ model, input: string[] }` → `{ data: [{ index, embedding }] }`.
7	 * Set `DREAM_EMBED_API=tei` for TEI `/embed` fallback endpoints:
8	 * `{ inputs: string[] }` → `number[][]`.
